{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Itni Shakti [D]Hame Dena Data
[D]Man ka vishwas [Gm]kamzor ho na
[G]Hum chalen nek [D#]raste pe hamse
[Gm]Bhoolkar bhi [D]koi bhool [Gm]ho na
[Gm]Door agyaan ke hon andhere
[C]Tu hamein gyan [Gm]ki roshni de
[Gm]Har buraai se bachte rahen hum
[C]Jitni bhi de [D]bhali zindagi de
[Gm]Bair ho na [D]kisi ka kisi se
[D]Bhawana man mein [Gm]badle ki ho na
[G]Hum chalen nek [D#]raste pe hamse
[Gm]Bhoolkar bhi [D]koi bhool [Gm]ho na
[Gm]Hum na sochen hamen kya mila hai
[C]Hym yeh sochen [Gm]kiya kya hai arpan
[Gm]Phool khushiyon ke baaten sabhi ko
[C]Sabka jeevan hi [D]ban jaaye madhuban
[Gm]O apni karuna ko [D]jal tu baha ke
[D]Kar de paavan har [Gm]ik man ka kona
[G]Hum chalen nek [D#]raste pe hamse
